# Default is loopback. For access from your private Tailscale network:
# HOST=0.0.0.0
# ALLOWED_HOSTS=your-machine.your-tailnet.ts.net
# Exact comma-separated hostnames, without scheme or port. Loopback stays allowed.
# The Vite dev server reads the same list, so no wildcard host permission is needed.

# Optional overrides for the conventional complete local graph/evidence paths.
# Preparing files and measuring memory are explicit CLI actions; startup never downloads
# data, loads a research worker, or advances neural time. See docs/DATASET_PREPARATION.md.
# FLY_GARDEN_MALE_CONNECTOME_DIR=data/malecns-v1/graph
# FLY_GARDEN_BANC_CONNECTOME_DIR=data/banc-v888/graph
# FLY_GARDEN_MALE_MEMORY_EVIDENCE=data/malecns-v1/paused-memory.json
# FLY_GARDEN_BANC_MEMORY_EVIDENCE=data/banc-v888/paused-memory.json
# FLY_GARDEN_DATA_DIR=data/identities
